    {
      "text": "Framework diagram of three stacked chevrons for an eHealth action plan: the first lists action lines, outputs, activities and dependencies, and risks and challenges; 'Resources' lists skills and expertise, high-level resources and funding requirements; 'Strategic phases' lists implementation phases, strategic focus and implementation targets. The heading of the first chevron is cut off.",
